                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Congress should be protecting health care, not taking it away. We should prioritize middle-class tax relief, not giveaways to those at the top. \n\nWe should oppose these plans, go back to the drawing board, & write up a reconciliation bill that puts working people first.",
