                "text": "Congress doesn\u2019t need to take health care away from seniors to fix the national debt \u2014 let\u2019s start by ending tax breaks for large, multinational corporations that ship jobs overseas.\n\nThe House GOP\u2019s reconciliation plan is full of the wrong priorities. https://t.co/iEUMZPJKJA",
