                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "If the GOP takes health care away from millions of Americans, they should have to reckon with the fallout.\n\nAccountability requires data, so I've introduced an amendment to collect hard figures on how many lose coverage, see health outcomes decline or even die if the GOP's plans become law.",
