                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "The GOP can't secure the votes to take away health care from millions & cut taxes for the rich. So they\u2019re looking to win over members from rich states by raising the SALT cap.\n\nThe biggest winner? The top 1%. Instead of making the bill better, they\u2019re just making it worse. https://t.co/Fw2SJk6pI7",
