                "retweet_count": 39,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Maine\u2019s entire congressional delegation \u2014 two Democrats, a Republican and an Independent \u2014 has now voted against this deeply flawed and harmful reconciliation bill. \n\nMainers deserve better than a Congress that takes away their health care and saddles their children with unsustainable debt to fund tax breaks for the wealthiest people and corporations in our country. \n\nI am proud that Maine\u2019s delegation stood against it.",
