                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was an honor to host 2 of my colleagues at Togus VA Medical Center. \n\n@RepDWStweets is the Democratic lead on military construction, including the VA, on the Appropriations Committee. @RepMGP is a committee member too. I\u2019m glad they got to see Togus\u2019 good work firsthand. https://t.co/5R4JHOn1bN",
