                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We heard directly from Togus leaders and toured the under-construction mental health and substance use treatment facility. \n\nI fought for more than a decade to get this treatment center built and it was great to see the construction coming along. https://t.co/In9bUKD4GT",
